{
  "$schema": "./tokens.schema.json",
  "name": "rt-platform",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Общие токены дизайна ансамбля RailTech Platform (ARCHITECTURE §3): цвета, шрифт, радиусы, плотность. Версия 0.2.0 — SPEC-v3 §5.2 (docs/architecture/platform-frontend.md §3): затравочные цвета статусов (default) для заливок и границ, отдельные цвета текста (text) с контрастом ≥ 4.5:1 на белом и на светлых фонах. Читают: AntD-тема CRM и Платформы (tokens.generated.ts), Tailwind/shadcn ERP и Cabinet (dist/shadcn.css). Файлы шрифта в пакет не входят: Inter подключает приложение: Платформа — @fontsource-variable/inter (семейство «Inter Variable»), ERP — @fontsource/inter (семейство «Inter»); без них стек падает на системный.",
  "color": {
    "primary": { "default": "#1668dc", "hover": "#0958d9", "active": "#003eb3", "bg": "#e6f4ff", "border": "#91caff", "text": "#0958d9", "foreground": "#ffffff" },
    "info": { "default": "#0958d9", "bg": "#e6f4ff", "border": "#91caff", "text": "#0958d9", "foreground": "#ffffff" },
    "success": { "default": "#52c41a", "hover": "#135200", "active": "#092b00", "bg": "#f6ffed", "border": "#b7eb8f", "text": "#237804", "foreground": "#ffffff" },
    "warning": { "default": "#faad14", "hover": "#613400", "active": "#3d2100", "bg": "#fffbe6", "border": "#ffe58f", "text": "#874d00", "foreground": "#ffffff" },
    "error": { "default": "#ff4d4f", "hover": "#cf1322", "active": "#820014", "bg": "#fff2f0", "border": "#ffccc7", "text": "#a8071a", "foreground": "#ffffff" },
    "text": { "default": "#1f1f1f", "secondary": "#595959", "tertiary": "#6e6e6e", "placeholder": "#6e6e6e", "inverse": "#ffffff" },
    "surface": { "background": "#ffffff", "layout": "#f5f5f5", "muted": "#f5f5f5", "card": "#ffffff", "border": "#d9d9d9", "split": "#f0f0f0", "ring": "#1668dc" },
    "tag": { "blue": "#0958d9", "green": "#237804", "cyan": "#006d75", "orange": "#874d00", "gold": "#874d00", "red": "#a8071a", "purple": "#531dab" }
  },
  "font": {
    "family": "'Inter Variable', Inter, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif",
    "familyMono": "ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace",
    "size": { "xs": 12, "sm": 13, "base": 14, "lg": 16, "xl": 20, "2xl": 24, "stat": 28 },
    "lineHeight": { "base": 1.5715, "heading": 1.35 }
  },
  "radius": { "sm": 4, "md": 6, "lg": 8, "xl": 12 },
  "density": {
    "controlHeight": 32,
    "controlHeightSm": 24,
    "tableCellPadding": 8,
    "spacingUnit": 4,
    "touchTargetMin": 44
  },
  "antdComponents": {
    "Menu": { "itemHeight": 40, "itemBorderRadius": 6, "itemSelectedBg": "#e6f4ff", "itemSelectedColor": "#0958d9", "itemHoverBg": "#f5f5f5", "itemMarginInline": 0 },
    "Table": { "headerBg": "#fafafa", "headerSplitColor": "transparent", "rowHoverBg": "#fafafa", "rowSelectedBg": "#e6f4ff", "cellPaddingBlock": 12, "cellPaddingInline": 16 },
    "Card": { "headerFontSize": 16 },
    "Tabs": { "horizontalItemGutter": 20, "inkBarColor": "#1668dc", "itemSelectedColor": "#0958d9" },
    "Badge": { "indicatorHeight": 20, "textFontSize": 12 },
    "Layout": { "bodyBg": "#f5f5f5", "headerBg": "#ffffff", "headerHeight": 56, "headerPadding": "0 24px", "siderBg": "#ffffff" }
  },
  "shadcnThemes": {
    "cabinet": {
      "description": "Тема кабинета клиента «Legal Eminence» (CAB-FIX-2): navy — основной цвет, спокойный фон холста, сдержанные статусы. Ключи — имена переменных shadcn из dist/shadcn.css: тема только переопределяет их значения (новых переменных нет), выход — dist/cabinet.css и копия apps/cabinet/src/styles/tokens.generated.css. ERP и Платформа её не читают. Холст: --background (белый лист) на --muted (рамка и сайдбар); в Mini App их заменяют bg_color и secondary_bg_color Telegram (apps/cabinet/src/telegram/theme.ts). dark — тёмная тема Mini App (класс .dark), где Telegram не дал своего цвета. Контраст пар — contrast.test.mjs.",
      "light": {
        "background": "#ffffff",
        "foreground": "#343a40",
        "card": "#ffffff",
        "card-foreground": "#343a40",
        "popover": "#ffffff",
        "popover-foreground": "#343a40",
        "primary": "#1f2e4a",
        "primary-foreground": "#ffffff",
        "primary-hover": "#162238",
        "secondary": "#f1f3f5",
        "secondary-foreground": "#1f2e4a",
        "muted": "#f8f9fa",
        "muted-foreground": "#5f6b76",
        "accent": "#edf2f8",
        "accent-foreground": "#1f2e4a",
        "destructive": "#9e2a2b",
        "destructive-foreground": "#ffffff",
        "success": "#1e7550",
        "success-foreground": "#ffffff",
        "warning": "#8a5a19",
        "warning-foreground": "#ffffff",
        "info": "#2b4c7e",
        "info-foreground": "#ffffff",
        "border": "#ced4da",
        "input": "#ced4da",
        "ring": "#1f2e4a",
        "radius": "0.75rem"
      },
      "dark": {
        "background": "#17212b",
        "foreground": "#f5f5f5",
        "card": "#232e3c",
        "card-foreground": "#f5f5f5",
        "popover": "#232e3c",
        "popover-foreground": "#f5f5f5",
        "primary": "#82aaff",
        "primary-foreground": "#141414",
        "primary-hover": "#98bfff",
        "secondary": "#2b3746",
        "secondary-foreground": "#f5f5f5",
        "muted": "#1e2836",
        "muted-foreground": "#9aa8b5",
        "accent": "#1f2e4a",
        "accent-foreground": "#82aaff",
        "destructive": "#ff7875",
        "destructive-foreground": "#141414",
        "success": "#73d13d",
        "success-foreground": "#141414",
        "warning": "#ffc53d",
        "warning-foreground": "#141414",
        "info": "#69b1ff",
        "info-foreground": "#141414",
        "border": "#3c4a5c",
        "input": "#3c4a5c",
        "ring": "#82aaff"
      }
    }
  }
}
